---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service – Dayront"
  description="Terms of service for using Dayront's free online media tools."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Last updated: January 1, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      
      <!-- 1. Introduction -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          Welcome to Dayront. By accessing or using our website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use Dayront.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Dayront provides browser‑based media conversion and editing tools. The core principle of our service is that all file processing happens locally on your device — we do not have access to your files, nor do we store them on any server.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Service Description -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          Dayront offers free online tools for audio and video processing, including but not limited to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-white space-y-1 mt-2 ml-4">
          <li>Format conversion (MP4 to MP3, MP3 to WAV, and many others)</li>
          <li>Audio editing (cutting, merging, compressing, volume boosting)</li>
          <li>Audio effects (speed change, reversing, stereo to mono)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          All processing is performed locally in your browser. No files are uploaded to our servers. The website serves only static assets — HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and the necessary processing engine that runs entirely on your device.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. User Responsibilities -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          By using Dayront, you agree that:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-white space-y-1 mt-2 ml-4">
          <li>You are solely responsible for the files you process through our tools.</li>
          <li>You will not use Dayront for any illegal, harmful, or unauthorized purpose.</li>
          <li>You will not attempt to bypass or disable any security features of the website.</li>
          <li>You have the necessary rights to process the files you use with our tools — including intellectual property rights, privacy rights, and any applicable consent.</li>
          <li>You will not use Dayront to process content that is defamatory, obscene, harassing, or otherwise violates applicable laws.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Because we never see or access your files, we cannot monitor what you process. However, we reserve the right to block access to our service from any IP address or region if we become aware of misuse.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Intellectual Property -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          The Dayront name, logo, website design, and original code are owned by Dayront and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative works from our website or branding without explicit written permission.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Your files remain your property. Dayront claims no ownership over any content you process through our tools. Since processing is entirely local, we never have access to your files in the first place.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Third‑Party Services -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">5. Third‑Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          Dayront may display advertisements from third‑party networks. These networks may use cookies or similar technologies to serve relevant ads. We do not share any file data or personal information with advertisers — we don't have any to share.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Our website may contain links to external sites that are not operated by us. We have no control over the content or practices of those sites and assume no responsibility for them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Disclaimer of Warranties -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          Dayront is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-white space-y-1 mt-2 ml-4">
          <li>The accuracy, reliability, or completeness of our tools</li>
          <li>That the service will be uninterrupted, timely, secure, or error‑free</li>
          <li>That any errors in the software will be corrected</li>
          <li>That the results obtained from using our tools will meet your expectations</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          We strive to provide high‑quality tools, but technology is imperfect. Use Dayront at your own discretion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Limitation of Liability -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Dayront and its team members shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 dark:text-white space-y-1 mt-2 ml-4">
          <li>Your use or inability to use the service</li>
          <li>Any errors or omissions in the service's operation</li>
          <li>Any loss or damage to files processed through our tools</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized access to or use of our servers — though we note again that your files never reach our servers</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Since Dayront processes files locally on your device and does not store them, the risk of file loss or damage is inherently limited to your own device's capabilities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Changes to Terms -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms of Service at any time. When we make significant changes, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page and, where appropriate, notify users through a notice on our website.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          By continuing to use Dayront after changes are posted, you agree to be bound by the revised terms. We encourage you to review these terms periodically.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 9. Governing Law -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which Dayront operates, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising from these terms shall be resolved through good‑faith negotiation before any formal legal action.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 10. Contact -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@dayront.com" class="text-sky hover:underline">legal@dayront.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-white leading-relaxed mt-2">
          We aim to respond to all inquiries within 48 hours.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>
</BaseLayout>